:"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"太後"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0272","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0413","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"王太后"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m013-0059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p013","quote":"樛女"},{"mention_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0019","chapter_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12","paragraph_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:p-nanyue-001","quote":"樛氏女"},{"mention_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0042","chapter_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12","paragraph_id":"c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:p-nanyue-001","quote":"樛氏女"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m014-0030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p014","quote":"嫪後"}]},{"id":"tz9_dhl_ifo","label":"樛樂（南越列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"樛樂","mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0159","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0159","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"樛樂"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"樛樂"}]},{"id":"tz9_dhl_ifo_A","label":"廣德","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"廣德","mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0425"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0425","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"廣德"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"天子聞嘉不聽王，王、王太后弱孤不能制，使者怯無決。又以為王、王太后已附漢，獨呂嘉為亂，不足以興兵，欲使莊參以二千人往使。參曰：「以好往，數人足矣；以武往，二千人無足以為也。」辭不可，天子罷參也。郟壯士故濟北相韓千秋奮曰：「以區區之越，又有王、太后應，獨相呂嘉為害，願得勇士二百人，必斬嘉以報。」於是天子遣千秋與王太后弟樛樂將二千人往，入越境。呂嘉等乃遂反，下令國中曰：「王年少。太後，中國人也，又與使者亂，專欲內屬，盡持先王寶器入獻天子以自媚，多從人，行至長安，虜賣以為僮仆。取自脫一時之利，無顧趙氏社稷，為萬世慮計之意。」乃與其弟將卒攻殺王、太后及漢使者。遣人告蒼梧秦王及其諸郡縣，立明王長男越妻子術陽侯建德為王。而韓千秋兵入，破數小邑。其後越直開道給食，未至番禺四十里，越以兵擊千秋等，遂滅之。使人函封漢使者節置塞上，好為謾辭謝罪，發兵守要害處。於是天子曰：「韓千秋雖無成功，亦軍鋒之冠。」封其子延年為成安侯。樛樂，其姊為王太后，首願屬漢，封其子廣德為龍亢侯。乃下赦曰：「天子微，諸侯力政，譏臣不討賊。今呂嘉、建德等反，自立晏如，令罪人及江淮以南樓船十萬師往討之。」"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji113-010","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行；只接明示父系來源，闕代不造父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"tz9_dhl_ifo"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0159","c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0159","mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0159"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407","mention_ids":["c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r045-c01-m000"],"paragraph_ids":[],"table_cell_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r045-c01"],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"shiji-020-t1-r045-c01-m000","mention_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r045-c01-m000"],"kind":"table_cell"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":0,"table_occurrence_count":1,"passage_count":1,"passage_coun