:"延年","kind":"person","person_id":"8xz_mlj_r3c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0407","start":407,"end":409,"surface":"樛樂","kind":"person","person_id":"tz9_dhl_ifo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0413","start":413,"end":416,"surface":"王太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0425","start":425,"end":427,"surface":"廣德","kind":"person","person_id":"tz9_dhl_ifo_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0438","start":438,"end":440,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0454","start":454,"end":456,"surface":"呂嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0457","start":457,"end":459,"surface":"建德","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r045-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"以校尉摎樂擊南越，死事，子侯。","source_row":46,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r045-c01-m000","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"摎樂","person_id":"tz9_dhl_ifo","status":"contextual_provisional","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source_revision":8735632,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","person_id":"tz9_dhl_ifo","quote":"天子聞嘉不聽王，王、王太后弱孤不能制，使者怯無決。又以為王、王太后已附漢，獨呂嘉為亂，不足以興兵，欲使莊參以二千人往使。參曰：「以好往，數人足矣；以武往，二千人無足以為也。」辭不可，天子罷參也。郟壯士故濟北相韓千秋奮曰：「以區區之越，又有王、太后應，獨相呂嘉為害，願得勇士二百人，必斬嘉以報。」於是天子遣千秋與王太后弟樛樂將二千人往，入越境。呂嘉等乃遂反，下令國中曰：「王年少。太後，中國人也，又與使者亂，專欲內屬，盡持先王寶器入獻天子以自媚，多從人，行至長安，虜賣以為僮仆。取自脫一時之利，無顧趙氏社稷，為萬世慮計之意。」乃與其弟將卒攻殺王、太后及漢使者。遣人告蒼梧秦王及其諸郡縣，立明王長男越妻子術陽侯建德為王。而韓千秋兵入，破數小邑。其後越直開道給食，未至番禺四十里，越以兵擊千秋等，遂滅之。使人函封漢使者節置塞上，好為謾辭謝罪，發兵守要害處。於是天子曰：「韓千秋雖無成功，亦軍鋒之冠。」封其子延年為成安侯。樛樂，其姊為王太后，首願屬漢，封其子廣德為龍亢侯。乃下赦曰：「天子微，諸侯力政，譏臣不討賊。今呂嘉、建德等反，自立晏如，令罪人及江淮以南樓船十萬師往討之。」"}],"interpretation_note":"本列功臣事由或後續省稱；只標人物原字，保留摎/樛、僕/仆字形，不整格標人，不把子侯當父爵。"}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r045","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r045-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source":{"title":"史記／卷113","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷113","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷113&oldid=8735632","revision_id":8735632,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證14段，末段索隱述贊分層。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2及現代節標題，YL紀年模板僅去外殼保留原字。未核底本影像。","note":"索隱述贊另層，不混作正文。"}}},{"chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source":{"id":"table-witness-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷020","revision_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷020&oldid=2607036","revision":"2607036","accessed":"2026-10-13","response_sha256":"f3fb3f9b7ead59e58f522014810ad9faf46b4723ba0b65f6175d72422aa6e0f8","edition":null,"image_verified":false,"rights":"古籍正文公有領域；維基文庫數位轉錄依CC BY-SA，保留貢獻者署名。","rights_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/Wikisource:版權信息","review_status":"partial_named_entity_review","note":"各組表保留原欄題、原文、空格及合欄，不推不同欄題的接續。西元欄為數位編者增補；未明年份留空，不推世系曆年。未核底本影像